* [eq:trG2int]  L² tr G̃² = Σ_{k,l<d} G_{kl}² = ∬_{ℝ²} K(τ,τ')² ν(τ)ν(τ') dτdτ',
  K(τ,τ') := Σ_{0≤k<d} φ̂(τ−τ_k)φ̂(τ'−τ_k) [eq:Kdef]  — here a product of two integrals and a
