  g := (1 + dist(·,∂I))⁻².  This replaces the paper's (∫_I ψ_k)²-sum (§5.3) and gives
  |𝓔₁| ≤ 2L²B²(∫_I ρ/g)(∫_I g) ≪ L²B²·L·l ≤ L³B² l log l  — within the lemma's error (the paper
